course: dictionary
lesson: 1598
title: Checking health words
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A checkup is a visit to check that you are healthy, even when you feel fine. The words around it give you clues: «go for a checkup» and «a dental checkup» tell you it is a visit, and the check is about your health.
explain: Look for the clue in the word itself: check. A checkup is a careful look to find anything that needs attention before it gets worse. «A hole made by acid is called a cavity or decay; the dentist cleans it out and fills it, and small holes do not hurt, which is why checkups matter.» Small holes do not hurt, so you may only find them at a checkup.
fact: Checkup means a visit to a doctor, dentist or vet to check that you are healthy, even when you feel fine.
fact: «A dental checkup» means a check of your teeth by a dentist.
fact: A checkup can also be a check of a machine or car to make sure it works properly.
fact: A cavity is a hole made by acid in a tooth, and small holes do not hurt.
fact: Regular checkups help find problems early, before they become bigger.
exercise: What is a checkup? | A loud noise made by a car engine | *A visit to a doctor, dentist or vet to check you are healthy, even when you feel fine | A treatment only for people who feel ill | A visit to the shop to buy new shoes
exercise: Find the word for a hole made by acid in «A hole made by acid is called a cavity or decay; the dentist cleans it out and fills it.» | acid | *cavity | dentist | checkups
exercise: According to «small holes do not hurt, which is why checkups matter», why do checkups matter? | Dentists only see people who are ill | *Small holes do not hurt, so a checkup can find them early | Holes always hurt straight away | Acid makes teeth stronger
test: Can a checkup be for a machine? | *Yes, a car or boiler can have a checkup | Yes, but only for toys | No, only people can have a checkup | No, only in the summer
test: If you feel fine, should you go for a checkup? | No, a checkup is only for babies | *Yes, a checkup checks you are healthy even when you feel fine | Yes, but only at night | No, you only go when you feel ill
exam: Which of these is a checkup? | *a visit to the doctor to check you are healthy | a song for school | a bag of sweets | a race in the park
